WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:19.881
Mark: I can't wait to go to Movies After Dark tonight!

2
00:00:19.882 --> 00:00:22.668
Coby: Me neither.

3
00:00:22.669 --> 00:00:25.807
Mark: Maybe they'll show a monster movie.

4
00:00:25.808 --> 00:00:37.242
Mark: Last week we saw Return of the Zombie.

5
00:00:37.243 --> 00:00:45.933
Coby: I hope it's a spy movie tonight.

6
00:00:45.934 --> 00:00:50.174
Miss Gray: Coby, Mark, have you two finished coloring your maps yet?

7
00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:55.813
Mark and Coby: Uh . . . Sorry, Miss Gray.

8
00:00:55.814 --> 00:01:10.084
Miss Gray: Please get back to work now.

9
00:01:10.085 --> 00:01:14.461
Coby: Here's my map, Miss Gray.

10
00:01:14.462 --> 00:01:16.552
Mark: Mine too, Miss Gray.

11
00:01:16.553 --> 00:01:20.187
Miss Gray: That was fast.

12
00:01:20.188 --> 00:01:23.191
And I see five oceans.

13
00:01:23.192 --> 00:01:26.486
Good job.

14
00:01:26.487 --> 00:01:30.114
Miss Gray: Can you boys bring something to Mr. Lenny for me?

15
00:01:30.115 --> 00:01:35.640
Mark: Sure. What is it?

16
00:01:35.641 --> 00:01:38.009
Miss Gray: It's a lost lunch box.

17
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:47.778
Miss Gray: Mr. Lenny will put it in the Lost and Found.

18
00:01:47.779 --> 00:01:50.654
Coby: Here's Mr. Lenny's office . . .

19
00:01:50.655 --> 00:01:58.655
Let's knock.

20
00:01:58.656 --> 00:02:01.192
Mark: I don't think he's in there.

21
00:02:01.193 --> 00:02:08.765
Coby: Try again.

22
00:02:08.766 --> 00:02:11.788
Coby: Mr. Lenny?

23
00:02:11.789 --> 00:02:15.242
Mark: He's not here, Coby.

24
00:02:15.243 --> 00:02:17.841
But there's other lost stuff.

25
00:02:17.842 --> 00:02:20.822
Mark: We can leave the lunch box over there.

26
00:02:20.823 --> 00:02:26.668
Coby: Okay.

27
00:02:26.669 --> 00:02:29.782
Hey, what's that?

28
00:02:29.783 --> 00:02:32.855
Mark: This is Mr. Lenny's office, Coby.

29
00:02:32.856 --> 00:02:35.095
You shouldn't touch anything.

30
00:02:35.096 --> 00:02:37.076
Coby: But look at this, Mark!

31
00:02:37.077 --> 00:02:40.723
It's a weird note. Read it!

32
00:02:40.724 --> 00:02:42.583
Mark: Go after dark . . .

33
00:02:42.584 --> 00:02:44.247
Bring my money . . .

34
00:02:44.248 --> 00:02:47.597
Or else!
